            "title": "Know About Us",
            "subtitle": null,
            "body": [
              {
                "id": "about-paragraph-1",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Embark on an unforgettable 7-day journey through the enchanting island of Bali. From the lush rice terraces of Ubud to the pristine beaches of Seminyak, this carefully curated adventure combines cultural immersion, natural wonders, and luxurious comfort."
              },
              {
                "id": "about-paragraph-2",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Stay in handpicked luxury villas, explore ancient temples with expert local guides, master traditional Balinese cooking, and unwind with authentic spa treatments. Whether you're seeking adventure, relaxation, or cultural enrichment, this package offers the perfect balance of activities and leisure time."
              },
              {
                "id": "about-paragraph-3",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Our small-group tours (maximum 12 travelers) ensure personalized attention and authentic experiences. With all logistics handled—from airport transfers to entrance fees—you can focus on creating memories that will last a lifetime."
              }
            ],
            "media": {
              "type": "image",
